WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:01.885
Plan back from the meet.

00:00:02.333 --> 00:00:06.559
Set your meet date and priority. Then choose the weight class you are aiming for.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.498
It counts the days to your meet. Then it works your training blocks back from that date. Strength, specification, then peak.

00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:22.388
Generated workouts taper for the last week. It reminds you to rehearse with collars and meet jumps.

00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:28.452
It shows your weekly pace to the class limit. This is planning guidance, not medical advice.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.569
Lifting Lab is free to download. Pro unlocks this.
